/* Treasure Client: the loading screen (the same as the JS and WASM editions). */

/* Treasure Client loading screen.
   Shown from the first moment the page parses until the game draws its first
   frame. It lives on <html> (not <body>), so the engine clearing <body> at boot
   can't remove it. It never takes clicks (pointer-events:none): a click on it
   still reaches the game's own "press any key" listener. Steps come from the
   page (loader / engine / canvas) and from Java (TCBoot.java writes
   localStorage["_eaglercraft_1.12.tcboot"]). Animations only use transform and
   opacity, so they keep moving even while the game blocks the main thread.
   If the game crashes or the browser is unsupported, it gets out of the way. */
